program	ref_replace_existential_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot replace the referent of `&var any Shape` `p`: the concrete type behind the erasure is unknown
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot replace the referent of `&var any Shape` `p`: the concrete type behind the erasure is unknown"
log	"  --> examples/ref_replace_existential_error.saw:14:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 14 |     p = other"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: a differently-typed value would corrupt the caller's slot — replace at the `Box<any Shape>` level instead (a `&var Box<any Shape>` referent CAN be reassigned)"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
